### ============================================
### USER MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users
### Requires: Authorization header with Bearer token

@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@usersPath = /api/v1/users

### ============================================
### USER REGISTRATION & AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "***REMOVED***",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "username": "janesmith"
}

### Login (Legacy - Use /api/v1/auth/signin instead)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "***REMOVED***"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200 && response.body.data) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
        client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.data.refreshToken);
    }
%}

### Refresh Token (Legacy - Use /api/v1/auth/refresh instead)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (Legacy - Use /api/v1/auth/signout instead)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### USER INFORMATION
### ============================================

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

### Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Name",
  "username": "updatedusername"
}

### Upload Profile Image
POST {{baseUrl}}{{usersPath}}/me/profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

